Dear Mayor Collins:
Delta Dental of Wyoming has been pleased to provide the dental benefits to the employees of City
of Cheyenne.
The one year contract for your dental plan ends June 30, 2021.
Pursuant to the
provisions of the contract, we are notifying you of the renewal for the new contract period as stated
above. This is a one year contract and a one year rate guarantee. The new premiums are:
This represents a 0% increase for the above stated contract period. Please note that last year you
received a 0% increase in premiums.
Payment of your July 1, 2021 bill constitutes acceptance of this renewal for the above stated
Contract Term. You will only receive a new contract or addendum if your benefits are being
changed.
Delta Dental is always willing to present plan benefit changes to generate savings with minimal
impact to your plan. If you ever desire to see some of these options, including voluntary plans, please
give us a call.
We appreciate the opportunity of serving you and your group. Please feel free to call us if we can
be of any further service.
